{"id":"4010826077421411729","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"演唱會結束後一路哼著歌走去鼎王，沒想到才剛被安排在入口的座位，屁股都還沒坐熱，理想混蛋的成員們就從眼前走進來了🥹!!!\n\n離開時，還溫暖的比著愛心跟我們說再見💖\n\n喜歡上理想混蛋，才發現原來有些幸運，不只是聽見了喜歡的歌，更是親眼遇見了歌裡那份溫柔。\n\n今晚的偶遇，絕對是我今年最幸福、最幸運的瞬間了✨😭","username":"ellion_z","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@ellion_z/post/DepUREwk52R","timestamp":"2026-10-18T18:22:28Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-19T03:16:38.442656779Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:10.071272Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:10.071272Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_140bc4487793a687","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
