{"id":"4011020917480348429","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"老方的演唱會完全是大型同溫層與同樂會\n看到有BABY綁洋流漂帶入場\n粉絲聊天時自然而然地說1128沒辦法看準烘\n在翻譯把方爸說的대만翻成台北時大家會竊竊私語\n「愛與尊重」\n一直都是這樣實踐的，仍然會說出台灣而不是把所有的詞都用臺北取代（但倒是告訴我們吃了哪家臺灣的美食店啊我要去吃欸）\n好喜歡方容國，也好喜歡這個粉絲圈","username":"just_saying_cc","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@just_saying_cc/post/DeqAkXtE9sN","timestamp":"2026-10-19T00:49:35Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr"],"searched_at":"2026-10-19T03:16:38.442605391Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:10.071272Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-19T03:17:10.071272Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_9201fc4d4c158cc7","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
